>
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Munenori is a <strong>Web Director</strong> specializing in web-based branding strategy
    and direction. Backed by hands-on experience as a front-end engineer at a software
    company and a research background in Human-Computer Interaction (HCI), he handles
    <strong>everything from concept and UX/UI design through implementation direction
    and project management.</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>Vision</h2>
  <p>
    Across countries and industries, there are companies and creations carrying
    remarkable stories and narratives that have yet to reach the people they should.
    I have come up against this reality again and again in my own work.
  </p>
  <p>
    The skill of creating something worthwhile and the skill of delivering it to the people
    who need it are two different things. When work of real value remains buried simply
    because the channels of expression aren't in place, that is a loss worth fighting.
  </p>
  <p>
    That's why I use <strong>web-based branding strategy and direction</strong> to bring
    those works in front of the right audience, in the form they were meant to be experienced.
  </p>
  <p>
    The core of branding is a <strong>coherent philosophy carried through to the smallest
    detail.</strong> The accumulation of careful detail is what moves people. Delivering
    the value of the work to society, and a genuine moment of resonance to those who
    encounter it — that is the work I commit to, in both design and implementation.
  </p>

  <h2>Current Activities</h2>
  <p>
    While running his own studio, he partners with companies on:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Corporate websites and owned-media production</li>
    <li>Online shop / e-commerce build &amp; branding</li>
    <li>UX / UI design for business systems and SaaS products</li>
    <li>Product and project management</li>
    <li>Direction for logos and brand visuals</li>
  </ul>

