  <h2>Career</h2>
  <p>
    Began his career as a front-end engineer at a software development company, working
    on a telecom carrier's core customer management system and customer-facing web
    applications. His responsibilities spanned requirement-to-test design, giving him
    deep hands-on understanding of software development workflows.
  </p>
  <p>
    Went independent in 2022 and now focuses on web production, online shop builds, and
    UX/UI design for business systems — providing branding and direction across these areas.
  </p>

  <h2>Expertise &amp; Skills</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Direction / Product Management / Project Management</li>
    <li>UX design / UI design / Logo design</li>
    <li>Technical direction grounded in front-end implementation experience</li>
    <li>Branding and concept design</li>
    <li>Tools: Figma, Illustrator</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Academic &amp; Research Background</h2>
  <p>
    Completed his master's at Tokyo Denki University. Currently pursuing a doctoral
    degree as a working professional, continuing research in the field of
    Human-Computer Interaction (HCI).
  </p>
  <p>Three patent applications and two academic awards in related fields.</p>

  <h2>Value</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Holistic web / product design grounded in the brand's world view</li>
    <li>UX, UI, and implementation bridging — minimizing rework</li>
    <li>Project management scaling from small teams to multi-team initiatives</li>
    <li>Meticulous direction that produces outputs people genuinely connect with</li>
  </ul>
